		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A barely recognizable humanoid form amidst a gory mass of grafted limbs. Kyton sculptors of pain.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 33, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 claws +5 (1d8 + bleed), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Bleed</strong>. 1d4 damage each round. CON 12+, stabilize check, or healing to staunch.</p><p></p><p><strong>Regenerate</strong>. Unless reduced to 0 HP, regains 1d6 HP on its turn. Does not regenerate if wounded by a silver weapon.</p><p></p><p><strong>Surgeon</strong>. Kyton critically hits on 19-20</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
